            "paragraph": "The first of the two error metrics is a quantification of the size of the region of locally stable grounding line positions (Gladstone et al., 2010). This is referred to as \u201cRetreat minus advance\u201d (RMA) and is defined as RMA = xgr \u2212 xga",
